This project's inventory of invisible / format Unicode codepoints (zero-width
characters, bidirectional controls, variation selectors, and related format
characters) was seeded by reference to:

  watermarks-remover
  https://github.com/guillaumemeyer/watermarks-remover
  Copyright (c) 2026 watermarks-remover contributors
  Licensed under the MIT License.

The implementation here is an independent, dependency-free rewrite in JavaScript
with a different scope and API. No source code was copied; the debt is the
codepoint inventory and the general approach, gratefully acknowledged.
